IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-COMPOSITOR-LAYERS.

DATA DIVISION.
01 LAYER-COUNT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CSS-CASCADE-OK      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SEARCH-MATCH-CNT    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SYSTEM-SCORE        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-COMPOSITOR-LAYERS.
    IF LAYER-COUNT == 0
        GO TO COMPOSITOR-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF CSS-CASCADE-OK == 0
        GO TO COMPOSITOR-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF SEARCH-MATCH-CNT == 0
        GO TO COMPOSITOR-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 9999 TO SYSTEM-SCORE.
    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 LAYER-COUNT.
    WEIGHT 30 SEARCH-MATCH-CNT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

COMPOSITOR-ERROR.
    MOVE 0 TO SYSTEM-SCORE.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
